  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.1.3 stable: Big bundle since 3.1.1. BEP 44/46 server-side completeness (DhtDiscovery serves get/put queries; DhtMutableItems wires to local storage + Ed25519 signature verification; Ed25519Signer.VerifyAsync accepts raw 32-byte BEP 44 wire-format pubkeys which was a real production bug). Pure-v2 torrent parity through tracker + wire handshake + dedup + OPFS persistence + remove + service-worker streaming + HTTP file browser + UI (BEP 52 hashes). `WebTorrentClient.EnsureDhtAsync(DhtOptions?)` for multi-client loopback + custom port/bootstrap. `WebTorrentClient.DisposeAsync` now disposes the DHT (was leaking UDP socket). Dep-bump SpawnDev.RTC 1.1.1 -> 1.1.3 pulls in the new embedded STUN/TURN server, simulcast DTOs, SCTP burst tunables, and production TURN features via the companion SpawnDev.RTC.Server 1.0.3. Validated at hub.spawndev.com. See CHANGELOG.md for per-rc breakdown.",
